  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a63a5df88e4fc0a95cdd3e5f836d90c488ed61ff_0.webp\" alt=\"Mizuno Better Leaves\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Текстурпак, добавляющий спрайтовые анимации для съедобных и питьевых предметов.</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1170466/description_399a4e15-f79c-4e1f-8c23-53a97fcf7438.gif\" alt=\"тест\" width=\"400\" height=\"225\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Необходимо установить <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/eating-animation-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Eating Animation</a> для версии 1.21.3 или ниже<br></strong><strong>(Начиная с версии 1.21.4+ установка модов не требуется)</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Поддержка Farmers Delight для версий 1.21.4+</strong></p>\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Все мои аддоны Mizuno.<br></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizuno-better-leaves\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Mizuno Better Leaves</strong></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/unofficial-mizunos\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Unofficial Mizuno's</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizuno-connected-texture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno Connected Texture</a><br></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizuno-x-fresh-animations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno x Fresh Animations</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-dark-mode\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno's Dark Mode</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-connected-glass\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno's Connected Glass</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizuno-eating-animation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno Eating Animation</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-better-grass\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno's Better Grass</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizuno-copper-tools\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno Copper Tools</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-allay-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno's Allay Variants</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-chicken-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Mizuno's Chicken Variants</strong></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-chicken-variants-x-fa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Mizuno's Chicken Variants x FA</strong></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-fox-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno's Fox Variants</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-cow-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno's Cow Variants</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-cow-variants-x-fa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno's Cow Variants x FA</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-pig-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno's Pig Variants</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-pig-variants-x-fa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno's Pig Variants x FA</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-x-farmers-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno's x Farmer's Delight</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-x-storage-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Mizuno's x Storage Delight</strong></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-x-crate-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Mizuno's x Crate Delight</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-x-frights-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Mizuno's x Frights Delight</strong></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-x-display-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno's x Display Delight</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-x-rustic-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno's x Rustic Delight</a></strong></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-x-ubes-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Mizuno's x Ube's Delight</strong></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-x-vegan-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno's x Vegan Delight</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-x-handcrafted\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno's x Handcrafted</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><a href=\"www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-x-letsdo-farm-and-charm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Mizuno's x Letsdo Farm &amp; Charm</strong></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-x-letsdo-furniture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Mizuno's x Letsdo Furniture</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-x-letsdo-bakery\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Mizuno's x Letsdo Bakery</strong></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-x-reinforced-chest-barrels\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Mizuno's x Reinforced Chest &amp; Barrels</strong></a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Другие проекты:</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fShorkBee\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/130037dd8c972d8573f49d7928b542711e2f6ed4.png\" alt=\"Ссылка на ShorkBee\" width=\"90\" height=\"90\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/shorkbee\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c450b18c2c965d2e2a798f1576231a1f1f37458e_0.webp\" alt=\"Ссылка на ShorkBee\" width=\"90\" height=\"90\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
